# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Build output
**/dist/
**/build/

# Vite cache
**/.vite/

# .NET build output
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Environment & secrets (never commit real keys)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Local editor / agent config
**/.claude/
**/.vs/

# SPA build output. Vite builds the frontend straight into the API's web root, and
# `dotnet publish` regenerates it (see the BuildSpa target in api-dotnet.csproj), so
# it is generated, never authored. Source of truth is "NVC Claude version/".
# Deploys are Zip Deploy from the publish output, so nothing here needs committing.
api-dotnet/wwwroot/

# Logs & OS cruft
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
